WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
Even penguins are going to show up in your room.

00:00:02.421 --> 00:00:05.821
This is honestly my best purchase from TikTok Shop.

00:00:05.822 --> 00:00:09.421
It's super affordable and basically a mini air conditioner.

00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:11.461
But seriously, it gets ice cold.

00:00:11.462 --> 00:00:14.901
It can cool a room, living room or office really well.

00:00:14.902 --> 00:00:19.381
It's small but powerful. There's a control panel to adjust fan speed

00:00:19.382 --> 00:00:21.601
and switch cooling mode on or off.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.740
Just add water on top and it's ready.

00:00:23.741 --> 00:00:26.261
It's wireless and the vent can move freely.

00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:28.541
It's on sale right now, so don't miss it.

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:30.161
I've left it in the orange cart.
